## 👤 Executive & Technical Profile

I operate at the intersection of **AI Systems Architecture, Production Engineering, and C-Suite Strategy**. Combining executive leadership experience as a **Chief People Officer in FinTech** with hands-on AI-augmented development, I design and deploy resilient, high-throughput enterprise systems 10x faster than traditional software cycles.

My work focuses on **Zero-Trust Backend-For-Frontend (BFF) patterns, automated PII governance, agentic LLM orchestration, and resilient cloud infrastructure** — bridging the gap between high-level business goals and production-ready code.

---

## 🏗️ Featured Production Repositories & Architecture Showcase

### 🤖 1. [nexus-ta-engine](https://github.com/milenamelo26/nexus-ta-engine) — *AI-Native Talent Acquisition & Analytics Gateway*
* **Architecture:** Zero-Trust BFF Pattern (Node.js/Express/TypeScript) deployed on **GCP Cloud Run** + **Firebase Auth** (Server-side Token Revocation) + **Firestore Native**.
* **Key Innovation:** Real-time ATS synchronization with **429/503 rate-limiting resilience** (header `Retry-After` handling), **automated 5-year PII retention & redaction pipelines**, and AI-assisted candidate evaluation using Anthropic Claude API with strict XML delimiter prompt-injection mitigations.

---

### 🛡️ 2. [nexus-team-360](https://github.com/milenamelo26/nexus-team-360) — *360 Leadership & Career Self-Service Platform*
* **Architecture:** Multi-Tenant Enterprise Microservice + Server-Side Row-Level Security (RLS) + Inter-Module OIDC Authentication.
* **Key Innovation:** Implements **Anti-Data-Fusion privacy protocols ($K \ge 5$)** to prevent individual data re-identification across modules, dual-checkpoint 1:1 compliance engine, and asynchronous batch synchronization using dedicated GCP Service Accounts.

---

### ⚡ 3. [nexus-apply-gateway](https://github.com/milenamelo26/nexus-apply-gateway) — *Secure Candidate Submission & AI Evaluation Pipeline*
* **Architecture:** Edge-Optimized Serverless Gateway + Asynchronous Agentic Evaluation Pipeline + GCP Secret Manager.
* **Key Innovation:** Fully decoupled client-side presentation from internal data sources. Features single-use JWT verification, IP hashing (SHA-256), and synchronous LLM scoring recalculation on the server to prevent prompt-injection state tampering.

---

